          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1) Arrival by Air"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For those journeying from Europe, the skies offer the most direct path to Hurghada. The city is served by an International Airport, providing direct flights to major hubs across Europe and the Middle East. These flights typically range from 4 to 5 hours, presenting a swift and comfortable travel experience."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Alternatively, you can opt for a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "flight to Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " followed by a short, one-hour domestic flight to Hurghada via "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Air. This two-leg journey offers an opportunity to briefly experience "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " capital before heading to the coastal city."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/full-day-trip-to-cairo-by-plane-from-luxor/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/full-day-trip-to-cairo-by-plane-from-luxor",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egypt",
              "newTab": true
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/contact-us/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/contact",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Upon arrival at Hurghada Airport, a 30-minute taxi ride is all that separates you from the soothing embrace of the Red Sea at your beachside "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "hotel"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "2) Traveling by Road"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "2wwwcryez066",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For those who prefer a road adventure, various transportation companies operate public bus services from "
            },
            {
              "_key": "2gx0xh3nz4jx",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "v2mibsqghu7i"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "9kpz0eumcr62",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " to Hurghada. Ticket prices vary slightly between companies, typically ranging from $10 to $20, depending on the bus type. These buses offer a comfortable journey, complete with air-conditioning and on-board "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000019"
              ],
              "text": "toilet"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " facilities."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/toilets-in-egypt/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/travel-tips/toilets-in-egypt",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "v2mibsqghu7i",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Among these, Blue Bus is highly recommended for its commitment to "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "safety"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and maintenance standards. This newer company provides regular, reliable "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000021"
              ],
              "text": "service and allows for convenient online booking"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
