    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "dywsxj63i0g6",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cómo ir a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "k4gf7j85vlt6",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "295wnofppili"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "295wnofppili",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1) Llegada por avión"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Para los que viajan desde Europa, el cielo ofrece la ruta más directa a Hurghada."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La ciudad cuenta con un aeropuerto internacional que ofrece vuelos directos a los principales centros de Europa y Oriente Medio."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Estos vuelos suelen durar entre 4 y 5 horas, lo que supone una experiencia de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000009"
              ],
              "text": "viaje"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " rápida y cómoda. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-alejandria/viaje/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/alejandria/como-llegar-a-alejandria",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Alternativamente, puedes optar "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000e"
              ],
              "text": "por un vuelo a El Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " seguido de un corto vuelo nacional de una hora a Hurghada vía Egypt Air."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Este viaje de dos etapas te ofrece la oportunidad de conocer brevemente la capital de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " antes de dirigirte a la ciudad costera. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/el-corazon-espiritual-de-el-cairo-excursion-islamica-de-un-dia-por-el-cairo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/tour-privado-por-el-cairo-islamico-ciudadela-mezquitas-y-jan-el-jalili",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-abu-simble/el-templo-de-amada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/abu-simbel/el-templo-de-amada",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A tu llegada al "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "aeropuerto de Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", un trayecto de 30 minutos en taxi es todo lo que te separa del relajante abrazo del Mar Rojo en tu hotel junto a la playa."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "2) Viajar por carretera"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "Para quienes prefieran una aventura por"
            },
            {
              "_key": "1s4b7tnr8dhv",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " carretera, varias empresas de transporte operan servicios públicos de autobús de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "25mi2s0jcw61",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "b0q1fv4v0iuq"
              ],
              "text": "El Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "3ke27swutjld",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " a Hurghada."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Los precios de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000023"
              ],
              "text": "los billetes varían ligeramente de una"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " compañía a otra, oscilando normalmente entre 10 y 20 \\$, según el tipo de autobús."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Estos autobuses ofrecen un viaje cómodo, con aire acondicionado y aseos a bordo. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/lago-nasser/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/lago-nasser",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/los-coptos-de-egipto-guardianes-de-una-antigua-fe/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/los-coptos-de-egipto-guardianes-de-una-antigua-fe",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "b0q1fv4v0iuq",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Entre ellas, Blue Bus es muy recomendable por su compromiso con "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002a"
              ],
              "text": "las normas de seguridad"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " y mantenimiento."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Esta empresa más reciente ofrece un servicio regular y fiable, y permite hacer cómodas reservas online. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
